r ( chooses cards in order )\n\nSettings\n\nMenu Keybind ( for windows )\nButton Toggle ( for every device )\nmenu accent (color)\nwatermark\nnotifications ( turns all notifications on/off )\nhdie gui on start\nchange ui size ( x size, y size )\nunload menu\nwebhook configuration ( ping user, secret ping, test webhook )\nGui Configs ( auto load selected config, loads ur entire gui selected setting on execution )\n\n\n\nMore features will be added these won't be all, by the time you're seeing this there are probably more and every single suggestion will be added as soon as possible.\n\nmore games to come stay tuned.","tags":["roblox","animevanguards","script","free","undetected"],"script":"--[[ \n\ndiscord server for updates and features/information/help : https://discord.gg/quantumwtf\n\n--]]\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://api.luarmor.net/files/v3/loaders/e3cc7e48055222fbdc0e3228a36766a6.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"630a5948797de5f18052c1c8","username":"farzad","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6898721a9f5777db795ca2e6b3edda31a42004bc7446230035a59ea011217ec8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/630a5948797de5f18052c1c8-1730142745449.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"630a5948797de5f18052c1c8","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6898721a9f5777db795ca2e6b3edda31a42004bc7446230035a59ea011217ec8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/630a5948797de5f18052c1c8-1730142745449.jpg"}},"verified":true,"keyLink":"","views":223172,"scriptType":"paid","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2024-10-28T19:22:04.386Z","dislikeCount":1,"likeCount":3,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-03c2c8ef3b93d74243c16419bb64e971/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-03c2c8ef3b93d74243c16419bb64e971/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter"},"executes":224,"key